---
args: {"promises": "PromiseEpisode[]", "progress": "PromiseProgress[]", "prerequisites": "ContinuityPrerequisite[]", "docket": "DepartureDocket", "prior": "HandoverPortfolio | null"}
returns: "OwnershipSlice[]"
---
Partition remaining scope into independently accountable slices. Compare candidate successor remit, stated capacity and required capability; a meeting mention is not consent to transfer. Reuse prior accepted slices only if their scope and prerequisites remain current. A partial acceptance creates a separate unowned residual before any transfer status changes. Preserve declined portions and checkpoints explicitly. Proposed cadence or an unconfirmed next step cannot establish continuity closure.
